2025-11-05 14:33:48 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-05 14:33:48 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-05 14:33:48 [kimi-k2-0905] //  fountain_bridge.hpp  –  POSIX-only, C++17
