2025-11-18 16:27:21 [gpt-5.1-2025] Here’s a minimal, version‑friendly shape for a `NitroTaskRunner`, plus the required V8 platform
2025-11-18 16:27:21 [gpt-5.1-2025] setup around it. This keeps things as bare as possible and doesn’t commit to any DSP details yet.
2025-11-18 16:27:21 [gpt-5.1-2025] 
