2025-11-19 10:10:30 [gpt-5.1-2025] 
2025-11-19 10:10:30 [gpt-5.1-2025] You’re building with:
2025-11-19 10:10:30 [gpt-5.1-2025] 
2025-11-19 10:10:30 [gpt-5.1-2025] 
