2025-11-20 15:34:25 [gemini-3-pro] Here are a few specific observations regarding the implementation logic:
2025-11-20 15:34:25 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-20 15:34:25 [gemini-3-pro] 1.  `NitroPageAllocator::SetPermissions` Implementation
