2025-11-27 14:36:08 [grok-4-1] Both files have fountain → local → fountain paths:
2025-11-27 14:36:08 [grok-4-1] 
2025-11-27 14:36:08 [grok-4-1] • sloppypipe* (broken):
2025-11-27 14:36:08 [grok-4-1] 
