2025-11-27 18:13:22 [grok-4-1] 
2025-11-27 18:13:22 [grok-4-1] async read(){
2025-11-27 18:13:22 [grok-4-1] 	return readStream(this.connection, this.connection.rid);
2025-11-27 18:13:22 [grok-4-1] }
