2025-11-30 13:13:38 [gemini-3-pro] • Note on Speed:*
2025-11-30 13:13:38 [gemini-3-pro] If the RP2040 is faster than the C64 (it is), the RP2040 needs to wait for the C64 to acknowledge
2025-11-30 13:13:38 [gemini-3-pro] the read (via PC2) before putting the next byte on the bus, otherwise, the C64 will miss bytes.
2025-11-30 13:13:38 [gemini-3-pro] 
