2025-11-30 13:48:05 [gemini-3-pro] Common User Port Devices
2025-11-30 13:48:05 [gemini-3-pro] The User Port (PB0-PB7, plus handshaking lines) is a versatile parallel/serial port. Common devices
2025-11-30 13:48:05 [gemini-3-pro] include:
2025-11-30 13:48:05 [gemini-3-pro] • Modems: Commodore 1650, 1660, 1670, and modern Wi-Fi modems (ESP8266/32 based).
