2025-12-01 22:37:08 [gemini-3-pro]     *   /CE (Cartridge Enable)
2025-12-01 22:37:08 [gemini-3-pro]     *   /OE (Output Enable)
2025-12-01 22:37:08 [gemini-3-pro]     *   /LWR (Lower Byte Write)
2025-12-01 22:37:08 [gemini-3-pro]     *   /UWR (Upper Byte Write)
2025-12-01 22:37:08 [gemini-3-pro]     *   /AS (Address Strobe)
2025-12-01 22:37:08 [gemini-3-pro]     *   /DTACK (Data Acknowledge)
2025-12-01 22:37:08 [gemini-3-pro]     *   /VRES (Reset)
