2025-12-01 22:37:08 [gemini-3-pro] • Project Crumpet Utilization:*
2025-12-01 22:37:08 [gemini-3-pro] Your specification uses GP0 through GP28, which utilizes every available exposed pin on a
2025-12-01 22:37:08 [gemini-3-pro] standard Pico, plus internal pins GP23, GP24, and GP25 for system functions.
