2025-12-01 22:40:06 [gemini-3-pro] • Mandatory PCB (Mechanical Requirement)*
2025-12-01 22:40:06 [gemini-3-pro] These designs rely on the circuit board itself to act as the connector (gold fingers).
2025-12-01 22:40:06 [gemini-3-pro] • Crumpet (Megadrive): Requires "plated 64 finger edge connector" to insert into the
2025-12-01 22:40:06 [gemini-3-pro] console.
