2025-12-01 23:03:21 [gemini-3-pro] 1. Megadrive Cartridge Specifications
2025-12-01 23:03:21 [gemini-3-pro] • Total Pins: 64 pins (32 per side).
2025-12-01 23:03:21 [gemini-3-pro] • Address Lines: 23 lines (A1–A23). Note: A0 is internal to the console for byte
2025-12-01 23:03:21 [gemini-3-pro] selection.
2025-12-01 23:03:21 [gemini-3-pro] • Data Lines: 16 lines (D0–D15).
2025-12-01 23:03:21 [gemini-3-pro] • Other Lines: /CE, /OE, /LWR, /UWR, /AS, /DTACK, /VRES, /TIME, VCC, GND, CLK, /MRES,
